{
  "id": "bigville_bells",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "depends_on": [],
  "self_load_only": true,
  "description": "bigville R31 (block 320000): the church BELLS are the clock -- time is NOT forced. Removes the smuggled global clock (town.sunday=1 driving every agent). The church has_bell a Bell; the sexton rings it (one world event, ring_armed). bl_ring emits a BellPeal{hour,kind,call_strength} from the church -- the ONLY time signal, there is no global `now`. bl_hear_awake: an AWAKE resident hears the peal and LEARNS the hour (known_hour=peal.hour) -- the bell tells the time, nobody reads a global clock. bl_wake_rested: an asleep but SUFFICIENTLY RESTED resident WAKES at the bell (asleep->0) and learns the hour; an EXHAUSTED sleeper matches neither -> sleeps through, stays asleep, never learns the time. bl_decide: an awake resident who heard a SERVICE peal CHOOSES whether to answer by a collapse over {go,stay} (attend_sign*(piety*call_strength - worldly_pull)) -- the bell calls, the resident chooses. bl_attend: a 'go' resident joins the congregation. Events are not scripted onto everyone: one who slept through never perceived the call and cannot attend. known_hour is per-resident, set only by hearing a bell (unknown = absence).",
  "nodes": [],
  "edges": [],
  "productions": [],
  "concepts": [],
  "rules": [
    {
      "name": "bl_ring",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "The sexton rings the bell (ring_armed): the church emits one BellPeal -- the town's only time signal.",
      "match": [
        [
          "town",
          "has_church",
          "church"
        ],
        [
          "church",
          "has_bell",
          "bell"
        ]
      ],
      "where": {
        "type": "Eq",
        "a": {
          "type": "Plus",
          "items": [
            {
              "type": "Attr",
              "node": {
                "type": "Var",
                "name": "bell"
              },
              "key": "ring_armed"
            },
            {
              "type": "Lit",
              "value": 0.0
            }
          ]
        },
        "b": {
          "type": "Lit",
          "value": 1.0
        }
      },
      "effects": [
        [
          "add_node",
          "peal",
          "BellPeal",
          {
            "hour": {
              "__term__": {
                "type": "Plus",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "type": "Attr",
                    "node": {
                      "type": "Var",
                      "name": "bell"
                    },
                    "key": "toll_hour"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "Lit",
                    "value": 0.0
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            "kind": {
              "__term__": {
                "type": "Attr",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "bell"
                },
                "key": "toll_kind"
              }
            },
            "call_strength": {
              "__term__": {
                "type": "Plus",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "type": "Attr",
                    "node": {
                      "type": "Var",
                      "name": "bell"
                    },
                    "key": "call_strength"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "Lit",
                    "value": 0.0
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        [
          "add_edge",
          "church",
          "peals",
          "peal"
        ],
        [
          "set_attr",
          "bell",
          "ring_armed",
          0.0
        ]
      ]
    },
